:"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっかけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷っていた時期にやっと決心できた瞬間が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ中国地方で歌った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっかけでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時から私の中のテーマ曲。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の最後に歌えて良かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花道を隣で歩いてくれた玲香の顔が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れられないぜー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きたくなかったな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"披露した曲全部思い入れ深い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらロマも他の星からも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる理由も生まれたままでも咄嗟も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンサーも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ドームでパフォーマンスできてよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/11/10/1913377/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このメンバーじゃなかったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいなかった、ほんとに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフの皆様、メンバーのみんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れ様でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/11/10/6969193898732.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type